<title>BELGIUM: Fortis AG 9 mos net profit up 21%.</title>
<headline>Fortis AG 9 mos net profit up 21%.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(figures in Belgian francs):</p>
<p>    Net profit (billions)	10.052  vs   8.313</p>
<p>    Earnings per share(francs)*   266  vs     231</p>
<p>    Number shares	    37,739,642  vs  35,755,528</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis, which is owned jointly by Belgium's Fortis AG and the Netherlands' Fortis AMEV, said group net profit rose 18 percent to 554 million ECUs. * Previous year EPS figure adjusted to take account of capital increases.</p>
</text>
